WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
AdProof AI helps small brands review advertising claims, repair a

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
creative, and inspect what changed. Meta models support a traceable

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
evidence workflow. A higher score alone never approves an edit.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
This fictional bottle has supplied facts: stainless steel, six hundred

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
milliliters, and a screw cap. No fact establishes twenty four

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
hours of cooling. The recording shows real production model results.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Muse Spark reads the creative and compares concrete claims with supplied

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
facts. Claim X Ray keeps each observation beside its actual source

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
image, without inventing location boxes or treating the advertisement as proof.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Proof Constellation connects a claim with its recorded fact quotation,

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
assessment, and repair advice. A quotation proves wording was supplied,

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
not independent product truth. Unlinked findings and uncertainty remain visible.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Repair addresses evidenced problems while protecting correct copy and product details.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Safe text areas can use source pixels and OCR; complex changes

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:15.000
use Muse Image. This recorded result removes unsupported duration and related wording.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Verify compares the revision with its original through a separate

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:25.000
Muse Spark request. It checks text, new claims, product identity,

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:30.000
branding, and active locks. Failed comparisons keep the revised export blocked.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.000
Claim DNA relates model observations across the audits. Missing from a

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:40.000
short claim list does not prove removal. The comparison slider lets

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:45.000
reviewers inspect the actual before and after pixels alongside the evidence.

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:50.000
Twelve styles and seven consistency locks guide deliberate edits.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:55.000
Choosing a preset makes no model call. Applying a style uses Muse Image,

00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:00.000
followed by independent verification. Locks guide the request, but every result still needs review.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:05.000
Choose Social Media, Website, or Print. Check Output renders

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:10.000
locally and reports actual PNG dimensions, without hidden generation

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:15.000
retries. Interpolation requires explicit permission and adds no native detail.

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:20.000
Composition adaptation creates a new aspect ratio and compares it independently.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:25.000
Recorded Website downloads are sixteen hundred by nine hundred, and nineteen

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:30.000
twenty by ten eighty. Print options report physical size and density.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:35.000
JSON saves observations and provenance. ZIP also keeps available images

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:40.000
and history. Import makes no model call. Explicitly rechecking a

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:45.000
saved pair uses one audit request, without generating the image again.

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:50.000
AdProof AI brings the creative, supplied facts, model evidence, revisions,

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:55.000
and export limits into one inspectable workspace. Real production evidence and

00:02:55.000 --> 00:03:00.000
source code are public. Human review remains essential. Follow the proof.
